   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "The next morning, at the Muranishi family table, Toru's mother Kozue sighs about the economy while Toru hums happily. His daughter Mayumi greets everyone, Kozue scolds his humming, and Toru brags that things are looking up at work. Listen to the family breakfast table first.",
